    "answer": "Libraria oficiala \"redis\" (care include suport nativ asincron redis.asyncio) permite operatii non-blocante: 1. Cand soseste o cerere, se verifica mai intai cheia in Redis cu \"await redis.get(cache_key)\"; 2. Daca datele exista (Cache Hit), se deserializeaza JSON-ul si se returneaza instantaneu; 3. Daca datele lipsesc (Cache Miss), se interogheaza baza de date SQL, se salveaza rezultatul in Redis cu timp de expirare (\"await redis.set(cache_key, json_str, ex=300)\") si se returneaza raspunsul.",
    "codeSnippet": "import redis.asyncio as aioredis\nimport json\n\nredis_client = aioredis.from_url(\"redis://localhost:6379\", decode_responses=True)\n\nasync def get_job_by_id(job_id: int):\n    cache_key = f\"job:{job_id}\"\n    cached = await redis_client.get(cache_key)\n    if cached:\n        return json.loads(cached) # Cache Hit!\n        \n    job = await fetch_from_db(job_id) # Cache Miss\n    await redis_client.set(cache_key, json.dumps(job), ex=300) # TTL 5 minute\n    return job",
